        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es un Pokémon valiente y perseverante\ncapaz de pasarse toda una noche corriendo,\naunque en el fondo no es más que un bebé.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s tough enough to run right through the night,\nand it’s also a hard worker, but it’s still just\na youngster.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percibe en forma de ondas las emociones de\nPokémon y humanos, y jamás se acerca a quien\nle da la sensación de ser peligroso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It knows how people and Pokémon feel by\nlooking at their auras. It doesn’t approach\ndangerous opponents.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "En lugar de usar la voz, se comunica con los\ndemás mediante ondas conocidas como auras\ny así pasa desapercibido ante sus enemigos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It uses waves called auras to communicate with\nothers of its kind. It doesn’t make any noise\nduring this time, so its enemies can’t detect it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su gran resistencia le permite correr durante toda\nuna noche sin problema, pero tanta energía hace\nque sea sumamente complicado seguirle el ritmo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s exceedingly energetic, with enough stamina\nto keep running all through the night. Taking it\nfor walks can be a challenging experience.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Percibe los sentimientos de quienes lo rodean,\nasí como las condiciones del entorno, mediante\nunas ondas conocidas como auras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It can use waves called auras to gauge how\nothers are feeling. These same waves can also tell\nthis Pokémon about the state of the environment.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Though infantile in appearance, it has the mysterious ability to\nread the minds of humans. The pure of heart are met with\nRiolu's approval, while those of ill nature earn only its loathing.",
